                <pb facs="0488" n="376" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg376"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Dawson to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bogota</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-03-10"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March 10,
                    1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Student demonstrations against the treaties yesterday. The President of Colombia
                    has issued a decree to-day confiding maintenance order to minister of war.
                    Motion to postpone consideration of the treaties has been defeated, 40 to 6.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dawson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
